NAME
    mkdir - Create a new directory through the userland filesystem service.

SYNOPSIS
    mkdir <folder_name>

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Create a new directory through the userland filesystem service.

FAT NAME SUPPORT
    The current Inu FAT provider creates and renames entries using FAT 8.3 short names.
    Long-file-name creation and rename are reserved for a later filesystem-provider extension.

EXAMPLES
    mkdir TEST

FILES
    /System/Commands/MKDIR.CMD
    /INU/HELP/MKDIR.MAN
